   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Here U Are is a Chinese boys' love manhua that was released as a webtoon and written and illustrated by D Jun. It was serialized via Dongman Entertainment Corp's Dongman Manhua platform from November 2017 to December 2020, with the individual chapters being collected and published into eight volumes.",
